
# The blog example: a self-contained app package that consumes the @cluesurf/site framework.

deck @cluesurf/blog
  mark <0.0.1>

load @cluesurf/site
  mark <0.0.x>

# the entry `seed boot` runs (its `boot` task): the Postgres-backed HTTP API
boot ./hook/blog

back ./back
hook ./hook
face ./face
book ./book
